# Normalise line endings so the repo stays consistent across platforms.
# Binary assets are intentionally NOT stored with Git LFS: the previous LFS
# filters produced committed pointer files (e.g. src/assets/hero.png) that
# could not be rendered without a local `git lfs` install.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.svg text
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
